# If you prefer the allow list template instead of the deny list, see community template:
# https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/community/Golang/Go.AllowList.gitignore
#
# Binaries for programs and plugins
*.exe
*.exe~
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib
/datapages

# npm
**/node_modules/

# Test binary, built with `go test -c`
*.test

# Code coverage profiles and other test artifacts
*.out
coverage.*
*.coverprofile
profile.cov

# Dependency directories (remove the comment below to include it)
# vendor/

# Go workspace file
go.work
go.work.sum

# env file (excluding env files in example)
.env

# Editor/IDE
# .idea/
# .vscode/

# Examples
example/classifieds/server
example/calculator/server
example/calculator/calculator
example/calculator/build/
example/calculator/.maestro/screenshots/
example/webcomponents/server
example/sqlitesessions/server
example/**/certs/*
example/**/grafana/data/

# sqinn-go SQLite
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.db-journal

# Local review documents.
review-*.md
patches/*

# Generated by internal/tools/render-pages in CI.
docs/index.html
